#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:18
msgid "DID Document v1.0 (deprecated)"
msgstr "DID 文档 v1.0（已弃用）"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:14
msgid "DID Document v2.0"
msgstr "DID 文档 v2.0"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:4
msgid "DID Specifications"
msgstr "DID 规范"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:19
msgid "In <a0>version 1.0 of the WHO GDHCN DID</a0> publication specification a single DID file containing all keys."
msgstr "在<a0>世卫组织（WHO）GDHCN DID 第 1.0 版</a0>发布规范中，使用单个包含所有密钥的 DID 文件。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:15
msgid "In <a0>version 2.0 of the WHO GDHCN DID</a0> publication specification, multiple DID files are created depending on your key needs."
msgstr "在<a0>世卫组织（WHO）GDHCN DID 第 2.0 版</a0>发布规范中，根据您的密钥需求创建多个 DID 文件。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:9
msgid "SHALL be cacheable"
msgstr "应当（SHALL）可缓存"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:7
msgid "SHALL be convertible from each existing trust network's formats"
msgstr "应当（SHALL）可从每个现有信任网络的格式转换而来"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:10
msgid "SHALL be mergeable (trust list operators can integrate each other's entries)"
msgstr "应当（SHALL）可合并（信任列表运营方可以整合彼此的条目）"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:11
msgid "SHALL be usable by all stakeholders required to verify health credentials in their operations"
msgstr "应当（SHALL）可供在其业务中需要验证健康凭证的所有利益相关方使用"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:8
msgid "SHALL describe a key-to-trust-anchor path for all specifications"
msgstr "应当（SHALL）为所有规范描述从密钥到信任锚的路径"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_did.md:6
msgid "The common trust list specification defines the lowest common denominator format that can interoperate between all included specifications and can support the minimal required features from each specification. This includes considering the minimum security requirements that satisfy each of the specifications. It was designed taking into account the following tenets:"
msgstr "通用信任列表规范定义了一种最低公分母格式，该格式能够在所有纳入的规范之间互操作，并能支持每个规范所要求的最低功能。这包括考虑满足每个规范的最低安全要求。其设计考虑了以下原则："
